{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國人工智能公司xAI在密西西比州擴建數據中心引發的社區衝突進一步升級。當地居民指控，數據中心配套燃氣發電設施產生的持續噪聲和震動嚴重影響日常生活，而最新報道顯示，代表xAI開展收購的房地產經紀人正在向附近居民提出購房方案，部分方案要求房主同意不參與針對公司的集體訴訟。此舉可能使南海文市（Southaven）一個名為Colonial Hills的社區出現大規模住宅易主。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584198.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:14.343193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:09:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.469666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.469666+00:00","content_hash":"0b0e018b4a22435fcddfdfa494b25384fd48d8314a4dcfeed72d43e39de854e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}